  "evidence": [
    "27 actual PostgreSQL cases: 18 existing native registration/freeze/drain and four retry cases plus five completed-replay methods. API47 and full worker127 (126 active/one existing opt-in retention skip) pass on the same8291 unchanged inputs with format/architecture.",
    "After actual worker publication, exact owned immutable completion can prove original retirement only for the current ACTIVE LEGACY target. Native/group/client/MFA admission and canonical provider identity remain mandatory.",
    "Current completed continuity validates original account/company/device/native parent, provider user/device/key fingerprint, immutable retirement times/provider generation, target versions and succeeded provisioning provenance. It permits later native refresh and valid terminal metadata version changes without rebinding.",
    "Old registration/freeze receipts replay unchanged; new registration/freeze operation IDs may record the same retained outcome without creating another device, queue request or freeze. A prior retry receipt can replay; a fresh retry of a successful ACTIVE target is denied.",
    "Drain reads the actual retained slot state. It does not fabricate zero, reopen LEGACY execution, retarget, acquire provider credentials or prove Mobile SDK shutdown.",
    "Missing, foreign and incoherent completion mappings, offboarding and target revocation deny recovery. New receipt failures, late admission/read failure, cancellation, interruption and thread flags roll back publication; exact retry succeeds.",
    "Initial27-case run had one fixture failure: enqueue rejected an already-expired request as V122 requires. The corrected scenario creates a valid request then cancels it before real-cooldown retry. Only the publication test file differs; production source is unchanged."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No group HTTP/Mobile caller, live deployment or new APK is enabled by this increment. Accepted retained worker provider proof is recorded separately at5b66e661; unchanged Synapse/SDK proofs were not rerun.",
    "Next expose admitted group discovery/contacts/selection/device/status/retry/freeze/drain transport and validate HTTP, OpenAPI and API/worker DI. Then group rooms/gateway and Mobile ownership integration.",
    "Mobile must confirm original key publication/readback before permanent freeze, persist an exact-target gate against all future foreground/background/process-restart SDK acquisition, drain pending reservations and native resources, and retain the original encrypted store namespace/passphrase plus uncertain sends.",
    "Protected-record handover review has begun, without Mobile implementation: SdkSessionPersistence serializes callbacks; record schema is strict. Registry closeOtherOwners retires only current entries and cannot serve as a durable gate.",
    "Normal phone28, live8b40/schema116 pushON/SMTP OFF, Mobile3d85d569/hosted gates and Starter9959c1d remain current. All54 groups and actual Apple runtime remain open."
  ]
